From c735902698053b91f1f9caa344550717e4d4cfa8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 00:52:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sprint 7a: nav dropdown surfacing personas, compare,
 partnerships

Adds a "For Families" dropdown with all 6 personas (each with an icon
+ one-line description for quick clarity), plus dedicated "For Schools"
and "Compare" links. Mobile menu gets the same content in a collapsible
section. Also auto-closes menus on link click, adds tooltips (title
attr) on desktop links, and click-outside-to-close for the dropdown.

Previously the persona landing pages, /compare, and /partnerships were
built but had no discoverable entry points from the homepage.
